{"stormtroopers(eng)" "This squad of elite infantry comes armed to the teeth with the finest weaponry available. Though they come at a high price, these highly skilled veterans are even equipped to deal with any armored threats they may encounter. With stamina and endurance that puts other infantrymen to shame, they will serve the Commonwealth with distinction!"}
