{"hero1_ger" "The \"Veteran Sniper\" is a well-trained and highly skilled marksman. His deeds in service to the Fatherland are numerous and have earned him many awards. This long and distinguished service has made him a valued figure in the Wehrmacht and he now serves his country by passing on his knowledge to new soldiers. However, in urgent situations this highly experienced officer won't hesitate to serve his Fatherland on the front lines!"}
